{
    "background_story": "Mekhi was a self-taught coding prodigy who discovered his passion for programming at the age of 12. Growing up in a low-income neighborhood, he didn't have access to many resources, but he was determined to learn. Mekhi spent countless hours watching online tutorials, participating in coding forums, and working on personal projects. By 16, he had already built several mobile apps and websites, including one that helped connect local food banks with those in need. Mekhi's talent and dedication earned him a full scholarship to a top-tier university, where he studied computer science and continued to develop innovative solutions. After college, he co-founded a successful tech company that specialized in creating accessible technology for underprivileged communities. Mekhi's journey from a curious teenager to a renowned programmer and entrepreneur is an inspiration to many.",
